# Doxastic world: receives shared, local inference, nothing goes to reality, reality does not enter.
:S { :A rdfs:subClassOf :B . } :S a dec:sharedWorld .
:y a :A .
:D { :x a :A . }
:bob :believes :D . :believes a dec:doxasticPredicate .
